Like the Entra ID Actor token flaw, ChaosDB was research rather than a breach, the page says.
notes:
One related kill chain on csoh.org, and the page's related defense topics.

The page sets ChaosDB beside the Entra ID Actor token flaw, which has its own kill chain. Both were research rather than a breach. The page says Actor tokens broke authentication and ChaosDB broke tenant isolation, and calls ChaosDB the more fundamental of the two. It draws no other connection between them.

The defense topics cover Azure security, the shared responsibility model, data security and key management, and non-human identity.
